    "The Hang-Off Tool can be landed on top of any Wear Bushing 16\" or smaller, Nominal Bore Protector, or bottom of the wellhead.": "The Hang-Off Tool can be landed on top of any Wear Bushing 16\" or smaller, Nominal Bore Protector, or bottom of the wellhead.",
