    "The SCR for each pump is selected before any well control problems arise. Standard policy is to measure the pump pressure periodically. It should be recorded near to the bottom for each pump at regular intervals and/or when conditions change:": "The SCR for each pump is selected before any well control problems arise. Standard policy is to measure the pump pressure periodically. It should be recorded near to the bottom for each pump at regular intervals and/or when conditions change:",
    "The circulating pressure required is only due to choke line friction.": "The circulating pressure required is only due to choke line friction.",
    "The conduit connecting surface machinery to the BHA. Transmits rotation, torque, and fluid circulation.": "The conduit connecting surface machinery to the BHA. Transmits rotation, torque, and fluid circulation.",
    "The landed load capacities provided are for reference only. Actual allowable loads depend on the EDPHOT model, wellhead configuration, and OEM specifications. Always verify the maximum allowable landed load using the applicable OEM documentation before use.": "The landed load capacities provided are for reference only. Actual allowable loads depend on the EDPHOT model, wellhead configuration, and OEM specifications. Always verify the maximum allowable landed load using the applicable OEM documentation before use.",
    "The length of the Hang-Off Tool is tailored to space out a 5\" OD drill pipe section opposite the lower pipe rams in your BOP stack. When the tool lands on a Wear Bushing, the upper body of the tool is safely below the shear rams.": "The length of the Hang-Off Tool is tailored to space out a 5\" OD drill pipe section opposite the lower pipe rams in your BOP stack. When the tool lands on a Wear Bushing, the upper body of the tool is safely below the shear rams.",
    "The length of the Hang-Off Tool is tailored to space out a 5\\\" OD drill pipe section opposite the lower pipe rams in your BOP stack. When the tool lands on a Wear Bushing, the upper body of the tool is safely below the shear rams.": "The length of the Hang-Off Tool is tailored to space out a 5\\\" OD drill pipe section opposite the lower pipe rams in your BOP stack. When the tool lands on a Wear Bushing, the upper body of the tool is safely below the shear rams.",
    "The most common external catch tool. Slips over the outside of the fish to grip it firmly using basket or spiral grapples.": "The most common external catch tool. Slips over the outside of the fish to grip it firmly using basket or spiral grapples.",
    "The pressure observed is twice the choke line friction because fluid travels down the kill line and up the choke line.": "The pressure observed is twice the choke line friction because fluid travels down the kill line and up the choke line.",
