    "The primary surface equipment that supports casing/tubing strings and controls fluid production flow.": "The primary surface equipment that supports casing/tubing strings and controls fluid production flow.",
    "The rate of change in wellbore trajectory direction (combining inclination and azimuth) over a set interval length, expressed in degrees per 100 ft.": "The rate of change in wellbore trajectory direction (combining inclination and azimuth) over a set interval length, expressed in degrees per 100 ft.",
