    "API recommended makeup torque ranges for standard regular rotary drilling bit connections. Proper makeup torque ensures seal integrity and prevents connection failures downhole.": "API 推荐的标准正规旋转钻头螺纹接头上扣扭矩范围。规范的上扣扭矩可确保密封完整性并防止井下接头失效。",
    "API recommended makeup torque ranges for standard thread connection sizes of drill bits.": "API 推荐的钻头标准螺纹连接尺寸上扣扭矩范围。",
    "API ring gaskets provide high-integrity metal-to-metal pressure seals for API Type 6B and Type 6BX flanged connections across wellhead and BOP equipment.": "API 钢圈密封垫为井口和防喷器 (BOP) 设备的 API 6B 型与 6BX 型法兰连接提供高可靠性的金属对金属压力密封。",
    "API standards nominal capacity & displacement data": "API 标准公称容积与排替量数据",
    "API surface wellhead body parts, ring gaskets, studs & packing specifications.": "API 地面井口阀体部件、钢圈密封垫、双头螺柱及密封填料规格。",
    "AV = (24.51 × Q) / (Dh² - Dp²)": "AV = (24.51 × Q) / (Dh² - Dp²)",
