    "Accent Color Theme": "强调色主题",
    "Access the complete well control Kill Data Sheet to compute maximum pressures, kill mud weight, initial/final circulating pressures, and step-down charts.": "进入完整的井控压井施工单以计算最大允许压力、压井钻井液密度、初始/终了循环压力及压井降压曲线表。",
    "Accumulator Bottle Requirement": "蓄能器气瓶需求数量",
    "Accumulator Capacity – Subsea BOP": "蓄能器容量 – 水下 BOP",
    "Accumulator Capacity – Surface Stack (gal)": "蓄能器容量 – 地面防喷器组 (gal)",
    "Accumulator Pre-Charge Pressure": "蓄能器充氮预充压力",
    "Accumulator Recharge Time": "蓄能器充压时间",
    "Action Saved": "操作已保存",
    "Activate and adjust the motion compensator to support only the weight of the drillstring above the Hang-Off Tool. Land the Hang-Off Tool on the Wear Bushing.": "启动并调节升沉补偿器，使其仅支撑悬挂工具上方的钻柱重量。将悬挂工具坐挂在耐磨套上。",
    "Actual Pump Output (bbl/stk)": "实际钻井泵排量 (bbl/stk)",
    "Actual length of the hole from surface.": "自地面起的井眼实际长度。",
    "Actual volumetric efficiency of the pump.": "钻井泵实际容积效率。",
    "Adjust the motion compensator to tension the running string slightly. Close a set of pipe rams on the neck of the Hang-Off Tool.": "调节升沉补偿器使下放管柱微受张力。在悬挂工具颈部关闭一组半封闸板。",
    "Adjusted MASICP for New Mud Weight": "根据新钻井液密度调整后的最大允许关井套压 MASICP",
    "After a change in bit nozzle size or BHA.": "更换钻头喷嘴尺寸或下部钻具组合 (BHA) 后。",
    "After a change in drilling fluid density.": "调整钻井液密度后。",
    "After any significant change in mud properties.": "钻井液性能发生任何重大改变后。",
    "After drilling a long section of hole (e.g., 500 ft.) in a shift.": "单班钻进较长井段 (例如 500 ft) 后。",
    "After pump fluid end repair.": "钻井泵液力端检修后。",
    "After the early warning signs the first positive kick sign is increase in flow rate at the flow line with pumps on. The entrance of any fluid into the well bore causes the flow rate to increase.": "在早期预兆之后，开泵状态下第一个确凿的溢流预兆是泥浆返出管线流量增加。任何流体进入井眼都会导致返出流量增加。",
    "Air Gap": "气隙高度",
    "Air Gap (ft)": "气隙高度 (ft)",
    "All Areas": "全部区域",
    "All connection threads must be thoroughly cleaned with a wire brush and solvent before makeup.": "上扣前必须使用钢丝刷和溶剂彻底清洗所有连接螺纹。",
    "All standard nominal values sourced from": "所有标准公称数值均来源于",
    "All values are editable": "所有数值均可编辑",
    "Allow longer reaction time for choke adjustments.": "调节节流阀时应预留更长的压力响应滞后时间。",
    "Allow mud returns to be weighted up and re-circulated within available mud mixing system capabilities.": "在现有泥浆混浆系统能力范围内，对返出的钻井液进行加重并重新循环。",
    "Allow pressure to stabilise and record SIDPP, SICP and Pit gain.": "待压力稳定后，记录关井立压 SIDPP、关井套压 SICP 及泥浆池增量。",
    "Allow pressure to stabilize and record SIDPP, SICP, and pit gain.": "待压力稳定后，记录关井立压 SIDPP、关井套压 SICP 及泥浆池增量。",
    "Allow sufficient time for disposal of kick fluid / de-gassing at the surface.": "为地面处理溢流流体与脱气预留充足的时间。",
    "Allow the pressure to stabilize and record SIDPP, SICP and Pit gain.": "待压力稳定后，记录关井立压 SIDPP、关井套压 SICP 及泥浆池增量。",
    "Already saved!": "已保存！",
    "Always follow the specific bit manufacturer's specifications when available.": "如钻头制造商提供特定规范，应始终以此为准。",
    "Always test jar function on surface before tripping in hole.": "入井前务必在地面测试震击器动作功能。",
    "Always verify OD, ID, and steel yield grade match the weaker component.": "务必核查外径 (OD)、内径 (ID) 和钢材屈服强度等级，以较弱构件为基准。",
    "An error occurred during calculation": "计算过程中发生错误",
    "An increase in pit volume is obvious & positive indication of flow into the well bore & can be easily verified. If an increase in pit volume is seen, shut off the pump and make a flow check. If the well does not flow, no kick is entering.": "泥浆池体积增加是地层流体流入井眼的明显且确凿的迹象，且极易核实。若发现泥浆池体积增加，应立即停泵并进行停泵观察。若井口不溢不淌，则表明无溢流进入。",
    "An internal catch tool. Enters the hollow inside of casing, tubing, or drill pipe and expands slips to grip the fish internally.": "一种内捞工具。进入套管、油管或钻杆的中空内部，胀开卡瓦从内壁卡紧打捞落鱼。",
    "An unexpected error occurred while saving the report.": "保存报告时发生意外错误。",
    "Angle of deviation from vertical (0° = vertical).": "相对于铅垂线的井斜角 (0° = 垂直)。",
    "Annular Capacity": "环空容积率",
