    "Stop rotary table.": "停转盘。",
    "Stopping the pump causes a reduction in bottom hole pressure equivalent to the annular pressure drop, so flow check is a reliable method of checking for a well kick. If the well does not flow when the pump is shut off and remains static for two or three minutes, then no well kick is entering.": "停泵会导致井底压力降低，降低值相当于环空压降，因此停泵观察溢流是检查井涌的可靠方法。如果停泵并静置两到三分钟后井口无自流，则表明没有溢流进入井内。",
