    "Tensile capacities, DC weights, ROP, ECD limits": "抗拉能力、钻铤重量、ROP、ECD 限制",
    "Tensile capacity of the connection.": "接头的抗拉承载能力。",
    "Test Pressure (psi)": "测试压力 (psi)",
    "The Hang-Off Tool can be landed on top of any Wear Bushing 16\" or smaller, Nominal Bore Protector, or bottom of the wellhead.": "悬挂工具可坐落于任何 16\" 或更小尺寸的防磨套顶部、公称通径保护套顶部或井口底部。",
    "The Hang-Off Tool can be landed on top of any Wear Bushing 16\\\" or smaller, Nominal Bore Protector, or bottom of the wellhead.": "悬挂工具可坐落于任何 16\" 或更小尺寸的防磨套顶部、公称通径保护套顶部或井口底部。",
    "The SCR for each pump is selected before any well control problems arise. Standard policy is to measure the pump pressure periodically. It should be recorded near to the bottom for each pump at regular intervals and/or when conditions change:": "各泵的慢速循环速率 (SCR) 应在出现任何井控问题之前预先测定。标准规程要求定期测量泵压。应在接近井底处定期和/或在工况改变时记录各泵的压降：",
    "The circulating pressure required is only due to choke line friction.": "所需的循环压力仅由节流管线摩擦压降产生。",
    "The conduit connecting surface machinery to the BHA. Transmits rotation, torque, and fluid circulation.": "连接地面机械设备与下部钻具组合 (BHA) 的管柱通道。用于传递旋转、扭矩和钻井液循环。",
    "The landed load capacities provided are for reference only. Actual allowable loads depend on the EDPHOT model, wellhead configuration, and OEM specifications. Always verify the maximum allowable landed load using the applicable OEM documentation before use.": "所提供的坐落承载能力仅供参考。实际允许负荷取决于 EDPHOT 型号、井口配置及 OEM 规范。使用前请务必查阅适用的 OEM 文档核实最大允许坐落负荷。",
    "The length of the Hang-Off Tool is tailored to space out a 5\" OD drill pipe section opposite the lower pipe rams in your BOP stack. When the tool lands on a Wear Bushing, the upper body of the tool is safely below the shear rams.": "悬挂工具的长度经过专门配长，可使 5\" 外径钻杆段正对防喷器组中的下部管道闸板。当工具坐落于防磨套上时，工具上部本体处于剪切闸板下方安全位置。",
    "The length of the Hang-Off Tool is tailored to space out a 5\\\" OD drill pipe section opposite the lower pipe rams in your BOP stack. When the tool lands on a Wear Bushing, the upper body of the tool is safely below the shear rams.": "悬挂工具的长度经过专门配长，可使 5\" 外径钻杆段正对防喷器组中的下部管道闸板。当工具坐落于防磨套上时，工具上部本体处于剪切闸板下方安全位置。",
    "The most common external catch tool. Slips over the outside of the fish to grip it firmly using basket or spiral grapples.": "最常用的外捞工具。套在落鱼外侧，利用篮式卡瓦或螺旋卡瓦将其牢固抓紧。",
    "The pressure observed is twice the choke line friction because fluid travels down the kill line and up the choke line.": "观察到的压力为节流管线摩擦压降的两倍，因为流体从压井管线下行并从节流管线上返。",
    "The pressure shown on the Kill Line Gauge equals the choke line friction.": "压井管线压力表上显示的压力等于节流管线摩擦压降。",
    "The primary surface equipment that supports casing/tubing strings and controls fluid production flow.": "支撑套管/油管柱并控制流体产出流动的主要地面设备。",
    "The rate of change in wellbore trajectory direction (combining inclination and azimuth) over a set interval length, expressed in degrees per 100 ft.": "在规定井段长度内井眼轨道方向（结合井斜角与方位角）的变化率，单位为度/100 ft。",
    "The slow circulation rate should ideally be": "慢速循环速率理想情况下应为",
    "The string is physically wedged in a dogleg, ledges, or keyseats. Common while tripping up or down in doglegs. Circulation remains normal, but upward or downward movement is restricted.": "钻柱在狗腿、台阶或键槽处发生机械卡阻。常见于在狗腿井段起下钻作业中。循环保持正常，但向上或向下活动受阻。",
    "Theoretical Pump Output (bbl/stk)": "钻井泵理论排量 (bbl/stk)",
