    "When the influx is out, stop the pump reducing the pump speed in steps of 5 SPM, gradually closing the choke, maintaining casing pressure constant. Record pressure, SIDPP and SICP should be equal to original SIDPP.": "当溢流排尽后，以每次 5 SPM 的幅度递减泵速停泵，同时逐渐关小节流阀以保持套压恒定。记录压力，此时 SIDPP 和 SICP 应等于原始 SIDPP。",
    "When the kill mud reaches surface, stop the pump reducing the pump in steps of 5 SPM, gradually closing the choke maintaining casing pressure constant. Record pressures, SIDPP and SICP both should be equal to zero.": "当压井泥浆到达地面时，以每次 5 SPM 的幅度递减泵速停泵，同时逐渐关小节流阀以保持套压恒定。记录压力，此时 SIDPP 和 SICP 均应为零。",
    "When the kill mud reaches surface, stop the pump reducing the pump speed in steps of 5 SPM, gradually closing the choke maintaining casing pressure constant. Record pressures, SIDPP and SICP both should be equal to zero.": "当压井泥浆到达地面时，以每次 5 SPM 的幅度递减泵速停泵，同时逐渐关小节流阀以保持套压恒定。记录压力，此时 SIDPP 和 SICP 均应为零。",
    "When the pump is at kill speed, pump kill mud from surface to bit, maintaining casing pressure constant.": "当钻井泵达到压井排量时，将压井泥浆从地面泵送至钻头，期间保持套压恒定。",
    "When the pump is at kill speed, pump kill mud from surface to bit, maintaining drill pipe pressure as per step down schedule (during this step drill pipe pressure will fall from ICP to FCP).": "当钻井泵达到压井排量时，将压井泥浆从地面泵送至钻头，按递减规程控制立管压力（在此步骤中立压将从 ICP 下降至 FCP）。",
    "When the pump is up to kill speed, maintain drill pipe pressure constant.": "当钻井泵达到压井排量时，保持立管压力恒定。",
    "When the retrieving string is approximately 20 ft above the LMRP, activate and adjust the motion compensator to support the weight of the retrieving string.": "当回收管柱位于 LMRP 上方约 20 ft 处时，启动并调整升沉补偿器以支撑回收管柱的重量。",
