    "Activate and adjust the motion compensator to support only the weight of the drillstring above the Hang-Off Tool. Land the Hang-Off Tool on the Wear Bushing.": "Aktifkan dan sesuaikan motion compensator untuk menopang hanya berat drillstring di atas Hang-Off Tool. Dudukkan Hang-Off Tool pada Wear Bushing.",
