    "Adjust the motion compensator to tension the running string slightly. Close a set of pipe rams on the neck of the Hang-Off Tool.": "Sesuaikan motion compensator untuk sedikit menegangkan running string. Tutup satu set pipe ram pada leher Hang-Off Tool.",
