    "OPERATION": "OPERASI",
    "Occurs when high mud hydrostatic pressure holds the drillstring against a permeable low-pressure zone. Pipe became stuck during a static period, circulation remains completely normal, but rotation is impossible.": "Terjadi ketika tekanan hidrostatik lumpur yang tinggi menahan rangkaian bor terhadap zona permeabel bertekanan rendah. Pipa terjepit selama periode statis, sirkulasi tetap normal sepenuhnya, namun rotasi tidak memungkinkan.",
    "Occurs when stationary drill collars contact permeable formation filter cake with hydrostatic pressure higher than pore pressure. Overpull increases with time; full circulation is maintained.": "Terjadi ketika drill collar yang diam menyentuh mud cake formasi permeabel dengan tekanan hidrostatik lebih tinggi dari tekanan pori. Overpull meningkat seiring berjalannya waktu; sirkulasi penuh tetap terjaga.",
